        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "案例 1：并列循环 → O(n²)"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "案例-1并列循环-on²"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "c",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "x = 0; y = 0;\nfor (int k = 0; k < n; k++)\n    x++;                    // O(n)\nfor (int i = 0; i < n; i++)\n    for (int j = 0; j < n; j++)\n        y++;                // O(n²)，取最大"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "取频度最大的语句：O(n²)。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "案例 2：两层循环（m×n）→ O(mn)"
          }
